    "_comment": "Agent -> tool permits (Guard 2). Source copy, generated from ai/agents/*.agent.yaml and copied to ops/opa/data/tool_permits.json at build. Top-level key tool_permits (not tools) so it never collides with the policy package path data.tools. `tools` per agent = what the model may call (design B section 2, exactly). `pack_tools` per agent = what the deterministic context-pack builder may fetch for that agent (design B section 3.2); never exposed to the model and only allowed with input.caller == builder. ADR-07: no agent, model or builder, is permitted a scoring tool.",
